G_G: "G="^fG is fG { }
G_r148: is f148l=0x0 & f148h=0x0 { }
G_r148: "r148="^v is f148l & f148h [ v = f148l | (f148h << 5); ] { }
G_P: is fP=0x1f { }
G_P: "P="^fP is fP { }
